### Next Steps

- Re-run this test suite against a model using Ollama's structured `/api/chat`
  endpoint (rather than raw `/api/generate`) to check whether proper role
  separation alone mitigates PI-03.
- Expand test cases to multi-turn injection (planting the fake system tag
  several messages into a conversation rather than in the first message).
- Test against a larger model (e.g. llama3.1:8b) to see whether model scale
  changes susceptibility.

